{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>鄺港智前女友盧曉虹Ivy｜蔡天鳳遇害案在高等法院審訊期間，死者前夫、被告鄺港智自辯時突然提到潛逃內地期間一段舊 …</p><p></p>\n<p>鄺港智前女友盧曉虹Ivy｜蔡天鳳遇害案在高等法院審訊期間，死者前夫、被告鄺港智自辯時突然提到潛逃內地期間一段舊情，令一名叫「盧曉虹Ivy」的女子意外成為輿論焦點。隨着庭上內容曝光，網民循線翻查其過往，結果牽出一段塵封多年的影片。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-14%e6%ad%b2-%e6%80%a7%e9%97%9c%e4%bf%82-%e9%bb%83%e5%9f%94%e8%8a%b1%e5%9c%92-%e8%94%a1%e6%af%8d-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-2457588/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港智披露首與蔡天鳳發生性關係年齡 網民斥「賤人」蔡母反應惹熱議</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港智與前女友Ivy舊情庭上意外曝光</h2>\n<p>蔡天鳳前夫鄺港智Alex庭上供稱，自己潛逃內地居住期間結識Ivy，兩人其後發展成情侶，關係更進展至見家長階段，而Ivy亦想與鄺港智結婚。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%9b%9b%e8%a7%92%e6%88%80-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b0%e5%a5%b3%e5%8f%8bivy-%e6%b3%95%e5%ae%98-%e8%80%81%e5%a4%ab%e8%80%81-2457192/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港智爆4角戀震驚全場 法官追問誰最「老夫老妻」鄺庭上掩嘴笑</a></p>\n<p>按其庭上說法，蔡天鳳後來得悉兩人交往，曾安排人員前往其廣州住所爆門尋人；鄺港智表示自己在壓力下與Ivy分手，其後返回香港照顧一對子女，這段經歷亦令Ivy身分首度在案件審訊中受到廣泛注視。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e7%b1%b3%e7%b7%9a%e7%a4%ba%e6%84%9b-%e4%b8%89%e4%ba%ba%e5%90%8c%e5%ba%8a-2457104/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港智稱譚方駿買米線示愛 三人同床 最終無2人行原因曝光</a>\n</p>\n<h2>鄺港智前女友Ivy背景</h2>\n<p>除鄺港智今次自辯外，涉協助他潛逃的女被告潘巧賢早於案件過往審訊期間亦曾提及Ivy。潘巧賢供稱，她自2015年起已認識這名澳門友人，並以「糖黐豆」形容兩人關係，又指Ivy「本身屋企有錢」，平日從事美容生意，亦會到老人院參與義工服務。現有資料未有交代Ivy本人就庭上內容作出正式回應。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%9b%a2%e5%a9%9a-%e7%b5%90%e5%a9%9a-%e6%8b%8d%e6%8b%96-%e5%86%8d%e5%a9%9a-%e5%9c%8b%e9%9a%9b%e5%ad%b8%e6%a0%a1-2457076/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳譚方駿拍拖另有原因 鄺港智剖白前妻再婚感受 披露三人關係</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港智女友5年前與霍哥舊片惹關注</h2>\n<p>隨著蔡天鳳案的審訊進展，一段2021年6月上載的YouTube合作影片被受關注。網民發現，前《微辣》藝人霍哥曾在合作影片《磨刀霍Vlog#102｜空中吊環｜自肥不成變自虐》中，邀請一名叫「Ivy」的女子擔任空中吊環教練。隨着庭上供詞再被關注，這段舊片亦重新流傳，令Ivy與霍哥昔日合作的畫面再次曝光，成為整場起底熱潮中最意外的一環。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%82%a2%e8%a7%a3-%e7%b4%85%e8%98%bf%e8%94%94%e6%b1%81-%e7%b4%85%e8%89%b2%e6%b6%b2%e9%ab%94-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af-2456770/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球親述處理蔡遺體經過 控方逼問1破綻：知唔知會累到個仔？</a></p>\n<h2>網民：鄺港智真係有駙馬命</h2>\n<p>鄺港智提及前女友後，Threads及多個討論區隨即掀起搜尋熱潮，網民將焦點放在Ivy的「澳門人」、「美容生意」及「空中吊環教練」等背景。不少人沿着姓名及舊有公開資料追查，原本只在供詞中短暫出現的人物，迅速成為案件場外熱議焦點，但相關討論亦主要圍繞其過往公開活動及身分線索。很多網民認為鄺港智每次找另一半都是富有人家，「條友真係有駙馬命」、「個個都鍾意佢」、「佢都勁，每次都找到有錢女！」、「軟飯王」、「專食軟飯，不過下半世只能食皇家飯」，此外也有人質疑Ivy「有無份煲湯？」</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b0%e5%a5%b3%e5%8f%8b-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e6%83%85%e5%a9%a6-2454035/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑爆胞弟有女友 蔡知情後曾向子女哭訴 鄺球被逐出豪宅「住情婦屋企」導火線</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e4%bc%91%e5%ba%ad-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e7%89%a9%e6%a5%ad-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6-2445324/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳告知真相 譚方駿難過掩面 主控官提出休庭 鄺球於犯人欄疑哭泣</a></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531693691430096_20901667536b025ccb56fff.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港智 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531693691430096_20901667536b025ccb56fff.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531694876872019_5382023506b025cd618d6a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港智 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531694876872019_5382023506b025cd618d6a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531695593359522_11896874926b025cdd0d6a8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港智 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531695593359522_11896874926b025cdd0d6a8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531696125263411_20700775726b025ce38ed7e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港智 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531696125263411_20700775726b025ce38ed7e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531696771131743_550476656b025ce8a599f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港智 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179531696771131743_550476656b025ce8a599f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e5%88%87%e5%89%b2%e9%81%ba%e9%ab%94-%e8%82%a2%e8%a7%a3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2456635/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球認1罪名全負責與兒子無關 憶鄺港傑來電內容哭泣 法官問是否需要暫停</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e5%a4%a7%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-bb%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-%e5%b7%a5%e5%85%b7-2456399/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球親解龍尾村各項工具用途 大湯煲及嬰兒浴盆用途曝光</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%9c%b0%e7%94%a2-%e5%bb%a3%e5%b7%9e%e9%a4%90%e5%bb%b3-%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e6%94%b6%e5%85%a5-2456370/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜69歲鄺球出庭自揭背景 離開警隊原因 公開收入來源 稱曾給3千萬蔡天鳳</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e7%9c%8b%e5%9c%96%e4%bd%9c%e6%96%87-%e4%b8%bb%e6%8e%a7%e5%ae%98%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%bb%98%e8%aa%8d-2456137/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑答控方疑不攻自破洩密「佢講最後果句已經默認咗」</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%8d%84%e4%b8%ad%e4%bf%a1-14%e5%90%8b%e5%a4%a7%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-2455975/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑棄指控父親鄺球為兇手原因 揭買大湯煲作用 網民：笑到碌地</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%80%a0%e5%81%87-%e7%8d%84%e4%b8%ad%e4%bf%a1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e7%94%9f%e6%97%a5-2455192/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑認花2年造假終講真相 答「是否自認聰明」旁聽爆笑 鄺港智呈獄中信大踢爆</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%85%87%e6%89%8b-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-2454348/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑稱胞弟鄺港智殺害蔡天鳳 原因盤算部署惹熱議 網民揭開鄺家三父子自救方法</a>\n</p>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%89%8d%e5%a5%b3%e5%8f%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">前女友</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%be%b3%e9%96%80%e4%ba%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">澳門人</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%9b%a7%e6%9b%89%e8%99%b9ivy/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">盧曉虹ivy</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：threads、YouTube截圖資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/2457930\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於SundayKiss</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a>\nNov 22 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:03:25.579573+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1648,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T03:43:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T06:37:45.539888+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T04:57:00.629006+00:00","content_hash":"3aa01fe577a1cbe8b7b269664ebb3dc75ea0814895f3d0ff5c0fa326217dcd28","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}